{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07369","headline":"奉饯郑中丞罢浙西节度还京 · 刘长卿","name":"奉饯郑中丞罢浙西节度还京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上移将星，元戎罢龙节。\n三军含怨慕，横吹声断绝。\n五马嘶城隅，万人卧车辙。\n沧洲浮云暮，杳杳去帆发。\n回首不问家，归心遥向阙。\n烟波限吴楚，日夕事淮越。\n吊影失所依，侧身随下列。\n孤蓬飞不定，长劒光未灭。\n绿绮爲谁弹，绿芳堪自撷。\n怅然江南春，独此湖上月。\n千里怀去思，百忧变华发。\n颂声满江海，今古流不竭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}